    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0306" n="230" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg230"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1847</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Extracts]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 2, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Senate so far has kept its agreement not to proceed with election of
                    President.* * * In all probability after Monday next Senate will proceed and Dr.
                    Henríquez will probably be elected.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
